        <div class="shell catalog-section" id="note-catalog">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><div class="eyebrow"><span>IDX</span> FACTOR INDEX</div><h2>笔记词条</h2><p>按因子类型与星级效果精确检索。</p></div>
            <button class="button subtle" id="toggle-quality"><svg><use href="#i-info"></use></svg>品质规则</button>
          </div>

          <div class="quality-panel" id="quality-panel" hidden>
            <div class="quality-intro"><h3>笔记品质与词条数量</h3><p>品质越高，可记录的词条越多。以下是游戏内的笔记品质规则。</p></div>
            <div class="quality-grid" id="quality-grid"></div>
            <p class="quality-note" id="quality-note" hidden></p>
          </div>

          <div class="filter-panel">
            <label class="search-box"><svg><use href="#i-search"></use></svg><input id="note-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索笔记词条" placeholder="搜索词条名称、效果或 ID" autocomplete="off"><span class="key-hint">/</span></label>
            <div class="filter-row" id="note-type-filters" aria-label="因子类型筛选"></div>
            <div class="filter-selects">
              <label>排序方式<select id="note-sort"><option value="type">按因子分类</option><option value="id">按词条 ID</option><option value="name">按名称</option></select></label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-toolbar">
            <p id="note-result-count">正在统计…</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-grid" id="note-grid"></div>
          <div class="empty-state" id="note-empty" hidden><svg><use href="#i-search"></use></svg><h3>没有匹配的词条</h3><p>试试减少筛选条件或更换关键词。</p><button class="button subtle" id="clear-note-filters">清空筛选</button></div>
          <button class="button load-more" id="note-load-more" hidden>加载更多词条<svg><use href="#i-chevron"></use></svg></button>
        </div>
