      <section class="app-view" id="view-community" data-view="community" hidden>
        <div class="shell page-head community-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow"><span>02</span> PLAYER EXCHANGE</div>
            <h1>玩家共享库</h1>
            <p>留下你的名字，分享可借出的笔记与器材；也能找到其他玩家正在共享的配置。</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="page-stats community-head-stats">
            <div><dt id="community-note-count">—</dt><dd>笔记</dd></div>
            <div><dt id="community-equipment-count">—</dt><dd>器材</dd></div>
            <div><dt id="community-total">—</dt><dd>共享内容</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="shell community-section">
          <section class="player-pass" aria-label="玩家名片">
            <div class="player-avatar" id="player-avatar" aria-hidden="true">?</div>
            <div class="player-pass-copy">
              <span class="step-label">MY TRAINER CARD</span>
              <h2 id="player-pass-title">先留下你的名字</h2>
              <p>这个署名会显示在你发布的共享内容上，只保存在当前浏览器，不需要注册。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="player-name-control">
              <label for="player-name-input">玩家名</label>
              <div class="name-input-row">
                <input id="player-name-input" type="text" maxlength="20" placeholder="输入 1～20 个字符" autocomplete="nickname">
                <button class="button primary compact-button" id="player-name-save">保存名字</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cloud-state" id="community-cloud-status"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>正在连接共享库</span></div>
          </section>

          <div class="community-toolbar">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow"><span>LIVE</span> COMMUNITY BOARD</div>
              <h2>正在共享</h2>
              <p>记下玩家名，直接在游戏里借用。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="publish-stack">
              <p class="auth-gate" data-auth-gate="share" hidden>
                <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-info"></use></svg>
                <span>请先登录后再分享。</span>
                <button type="button" class="text-button auth-gate-login" data-auth-open>去登录</button>
              </p>
              <div class="publish-actions">
                <button class="button subtle" id="publish-note-button"><svg><use href="#i-book"></use></svg>发布共享笔记</button>
                <button class="button primary" id="publish-equipment-button"><svg><use href="#i-card"></use></svg>发布共享器材</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="filter-panel community-filters">
            <label class="search-box"><svg><use href="#i-search"></use></svg><input id="community-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索共享内容" placeholder="搜索玩家、笔记、器材或因子" autocomplete="off"></label>
            <div class="filter-row" id="community-type-filters" aria-label="共享类型筛选">
              <button class="filter-chip active" data-community-type="all">全部共享</button>
              <button class="filter-chip" data-community-type="note">笔记</button>
              <button class="filter-chip" data-community-type="equipment">器材</button>
            </div>
            <div class="filter-selects">
              <label>排序方式<select id="community-sort"><option value="new">最近发布</option></select></label>
              <button class="text-button community-refresh" id="community-refresh"><svg><use href="#i-reset"></use></svg>刷新共享库</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="result-toolbar">
            <p id="community-result-count">正在从云端读取…</p>
            <span class="cloud-secure-note"><svg><use href="#i-cloud"></use></svg>共享内容由云端持久保存</span>
          </div>
          <div class="community-grid" id="community-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="cloud-empty-state" id="community-empty" hidden>
            <div class="empty-ball"><svg><use href="#i-share"></use></svg></div>
            <h3 id="community-empty-title">共享库还是空的</h3>
            <p id="community-empty-copy">发布第一本共享笔记或第一张器材卡，其他玩家就能在这里找到你。</p>
            <p class="auth-gate" data-auth-gate="share-empty" hidden>
              <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-info"></use></svg>
              <span>请先登录后再分享。</span>
              <button type="button" class="text-button auth-gate-login" data-auth-open>去登录</button>
            </p>
            <button class="button primary" id="community-empty-publish"><svg><use href="#i-plus"></use></svg>发布第一条共享</button>
          </div>
          <div class="cloud-empty-state cloud-error-state" id="community-error" hidden>
            <div class="empty-ball"><svg><use href="#i-cloud"></use></svg></div>
            <h3>共享库暂时没有连上</h3>
            <p id="community-error-copy">请检查网络后重试。公共图鉴部分仍可正常使用。</p>
            <button class="button subtle" id="community-error-retry">重新连接</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="app-view" id="view-compatibility" data-view="compatibility" hidden>
        <div class="shell page-head">
          <div><div class="eyebrow"><span>05</span> HARMONY CALCULATOR</div><h1>相性试算</h1><p>选择主力与两名笔记角色，加入契合度词条加成，实时计算传承评级。</p></div>
          <div class="page-head-art"><svg><use href="#i-users"></use></svg></div>
        </div>
        <div class="shell compat-layout">
          <section class="panel calculator-panel">
            <div class="panel-title"><div><span class="step-label">STEP 01</span><h2>组建传承组合</h2></div><button class="text-button" id="compat-reset"><svg><use href="#i-reset"></use></svg>重置</button></div>
            <div class="core-select-wrap">
              <img id="compat-core-image" alt="当前主力头像" width="72" height="72">
              <label><span>主力球员</span><select id="compat-core"></select></label>
              <span class="position-tag" id="compat-core-position"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="owner-selects" id="owner-selects"></div>
            <p class="form-note"><svg><use href="#i-info"></use></svg>契合度词条按每本笔记独立计入；主力与自身笔记的关系分为 0。</p>
            <div class="calculator-actions"><button class="button primary" id="compat-recommend"><svg><use href="#i-target"></use></svg>填入高关系组合</button><span>不含契合词条加成</span></div>
          </section>
          <aside class="panel compat-result-panel" id="compat-result" aria-live="polite"></aside>
        </div>
        <div class="shell compat-bottom">
          <section class="panel relationship-panel">
            <div class="panel-title"><div><span class="step-label">STEP 02</span><h2>关系分速查</h2><p>按当前主力排序，点击角色即可加入空笔记位。</p></div><label class="mini-search"><svg><use href="#i-search"></use></svg><input id="relationship-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索关系球员" placeholder="搜索球员"></label></div>
            <div class="relationship-list" id="relationship-list"></div>
          </section>
          <section class="panel level-panel">
